# Release matching external-reference authority and clear its cached references.
# A successful release also zeroes stored wrench and actuator commands, but
# does not itself publish an actuator command. Axis selections and control
# authority remain unchanged. Other valid references may drive the next update,
# which can recompute outputs before publishing them. No persistent stop is
# latched. Disable both twist and wrench selections
# through SelectSignal while retaining control authority when aborting control.
string identity_token
---
bool success
string message
